{"version":1,"content":"<p>【線索 😂】巴西國際機場 19 日發生 RTX 5090 顯示卡重大失竊案。</p><p>兩板裝載全新 ZOTAC GeForce RTX 5090 的貨物於聖保羅國際機場不翼而飛，沒想到事隔才數天，其中一張疑為贓物的顯示卡竟被賣家堂而皇之放上二手拍賣平台「OLX」兜售，且產品序號完全未經遮蔽，消息傳出後引來巴西網民瘋狂嘲笑。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T08:44:12.170757+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:32:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T07:18:10.997188+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:38:07.520644+00:00","content_hash":"c6f9633ab517ac4aed043d4fa9c635f1ee9fc5ed0edcef4fea32442706753bcc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}